Summon a Stone Golem for [6, 7, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns to attack your foes. Stone golems are formidable foes that can become unstoppable.

It will get [57, 105, 148, 188, 225 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Strength, [12, 14, 16, 18, 20 (TL1-5)] Constitution and [55, 101, 142, 179, 215 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Dexterity.

Your summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%, resistance penetration %, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.

The golem's Strength and Dexterity will increase with your Mindpower.
